WEBVTT

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:30.455
Biyo noqo saaxib. (Sacbis)

00:04:30.455 --> 00:04:34.557
YR: Sanadaan ayaan 32-jirsaday,

00:04:34.557 --> 00:04:37.676
isla da'dii uu Bruce Lee jiray markuu dhintay.

00:04:37.676 --> 00:04:40.270
waxaan la fajac-sanaay ayaamankaan,

00:04:40.270 --> 00:04:42.200
haduu maanta noolaan lahaay,

00:04:42.200 --> 00:04:44.226
Waano nooce ah ayuu isiin lahaay

00:04:44.226 --> 00:04:48.170
oo ku saabsan sameenta hadalkaan TED.

00:04:48.170 --> 00:04:51.908
HP: Codkeyda haiska doon doonin.

00:04:51.908 --> 00:04:53.979
weey ii gaftaa.

00:04:53.979 --> 00:04:56.009
(Qosol)

00:04:56.009 --> 00:04:57.760
YR: waano wanaagsan,

00:04:57.760 --> 00:05:01.472
laakin waxay weli umaleynaya inaan baranay qofkaan nahay